<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <!--
      The Guide's figures, written in a text as ![Bildtext](figur:<id>) and drawn by GuideDocumentView. Each is a
      DrawingImage with the key Figure.<id>, 560 wide (the reading column), and made smaller in the narrow panel.
      Generated in the graph's visual language and the theme's colours only: the accent is the victims' money, blue an
      exchange or a withdrawal, red risk and the end of a trail, purple another chain, grey the unknown and others'
      money; round is an actor nothing is known about, square a service or a tx; dashed always means uncertain, dotted
      a guard line or a guide. Lines have round ends, as the icons. The figures carry no words: the caption under each
      says what it shows. Figures for new sections go in GuideFigures.Sections.xaml, with the same keys.
    -->

